/T (CEERAVO is the unified visibility layer for critical healthcare logistics. By mapping facility capacity, specialist availability, and real-time operational status across hospital networks, CEERAVO eliminates the coordination gap in medical routing, turning chaotic delays into deterministic outcomes.)
/E (CEERAVO is the unified visibility layer for critical healthcare logistics. By mapping facility capacity, specialist availability, and real-time operational status across hospital networks, CEERAVO eliminates the coordination gap in medical routing, turning chaotic delays into deterministic outcomes.)
