/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 161 0 R
/T (In an emergency, the platform provides immediate intelligence on which nearby facilities have the precise equipment, beds, and specialists ready to receive a patient. For routine medical care, it streamlines access by displaying verified doctor schedules, enabling direct appointment bookings, and serving live queue updates so patients enter clinics on time instead of waiting hours in crowded rooms.)
/E (In an emergency, the platform provides immediate intelligence on which nearby facilities have the precise equipment, beds, and specialists ready to receive a patient. For routine medical care, it streamlines access by displaying verified doctor schedules, enabling direct appointment bookings, and serving live queue updates so patients enter clinics on time instead of waiting hours in crowded rooms.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [4]
